{"seq":3,"slug":"backprop-autodiff","title":"反向传播与自动微分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/dl-training-optimization/foundations/backprop-autodiff","wordCount":1735,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"反向传播与自动微分\">反向传播与自动微分</h1><p>前两节都建立在一个假设上：「梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla L(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是已知的」。但对一个有上亿参数、几十层复合非线性的网络，这个梯度到底怎么算出来？手推显然不可能，数值差分既慢又不准。答案是反向传播——链式法则在计算图上的高效组织——以及把它工程化、让任意可微程序自动求导的自动微分。这是 PyTorch、JAX、TensorFlow 的共同内核，也是「定义模型就能训练」这件事背后的真正引擎。这一节讲清梯度从哪来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-计算图与链式法则\">核心概念：计算图与链式法则</h2><p>任何前向计算都可以表示成一张有向无环图：节点是中间变量与运算，边表示数据依赖。一个简单的两层网络 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\ell(W_2 \\sigma(W_1 x))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span> 就对应一条从输入流向损失的计算链。反向传播的目标，是对图中每个参数节点求出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial L/\\partial \\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>它依赖微积分的链式法则。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 通过中间量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 依赖参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial w} = \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial z}\\cdot\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial w}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>反向传播的精髓在于「复用」：从损失节点出发反向遍历计算图，每个节点只需把它收到的「上游梯度」乘以自己的「局部导数」，再传给下游。这样整张图只需一次反向遍历，就能算出所有参数的梯度，总代价与一次前向传播同阶。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[输入 x] --&gt; B[线性 z1 = W1 x]&#10;  B --&gt; C[激活 a1 = sigma z1]&#10;  C --&gt; D[线性 z2 = W2 a1]&#10;  D --&gt; E[损失 L]&#10;  E -.上游梯度 dL/dz2.-&gt; D&#10;  D -.dL/da1.-&gt; C&#10;  C -.dL/dz1.-&gt; B&#10;  B -.dL/dW1.-&gt; F[参数梯度回填]&#10;  D -.dL/dW2.-&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n  A[输入 x] --&gt; B[线性 z1 = W1 x]\n  B --&gt; C[激活 a1 = sigma z1]\n  C --&gt; D[线性 z2 = W2 a1]\n  D --&gt; E[损失 L]\n  E -.上游梯度 dL/dz2.-&gt; D\n  D -.dL/da1.-&gt; C\n  C -.dL/dz1.-&gt; B\n  B -.dL/dW1.-&gt; F[参数梯度回填]\n  D -.dL/dW2.-&gt; F</pre><p>图中实线是前向传播、虚线是反向传播：先正向算出并缓存各中间量（激活），再反向逐节点把梯度乘下去。这个「先存激活、再回传」的两遍结构，是理解显存占用与<a href=\"../scaling/mixed-precision\">混合精度</a>、<a href=\"../scaling/training-recipes\">梯度检查点</a>的基础。</p>\n<p>把上面的链式法则落到一个具体例子上会更清楚。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是某个逐元素激活函数，考虑单个标量的复合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = w_2\\sigma(w_1 x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\tfrac{1}{2}(y-t)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。反向传播只需三步局部乘法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"前向:  z = w1 * x          # 缓存 z&#10;       a = sigma(z)         # 缓存 a&#10;       y = w2 * a&#10;       L = 0.5 * (y - t)^2&#10;反向:  dL/dy  = (y - t)&#10;       dL/dw2 = dL/dy * a            # 局部导数 a&#10;       dL/da  = dL/dy * w2&#10;       dL/dz  = dL/da * sigma&#39;(z)    # 局部导数 sigma&#39;(z)&#10;       dL/dw1 = dL/dz * x            # 局部导数 x\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>前向:  z = w1 * x          # 缓存 z</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       a = sigma(z)         # 缓存 a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       y = w2 * a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       L = 0.5 * (y - t)^2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>反向:  dL/dy  = (y - t)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       dL/dw2 = dL/dy * a            # 局部导数 a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       dL/da  = dL/dy * w2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       dL/dz  = dL/da * sigma'(z)    # 局部导数 sigma'(z)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       dL/dw1 = dL/dz * x            # 局部导数 x</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意每个参数梯度都是「上游梯度 × 该节点局部导数」这一同一形式的复现，区别只在局部导数具体是什么。这正是自动微分能够把反向传播通用化的落脚点：只要每个基本算子提供自己的局部导数，链式组合就无需人工推导。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前向模式与反向模式\">前向模式与反向模式</h2><p>自动微分有两种方向，理解它们的区别能解释为什么深度学习几乎只用反向模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>前向模式</th>\n<th>反向模式（反向传播）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>遍历方向</td>\n<td>输入到输出</td>\n<td>输出到输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一次遍历得到</td>\n<td>一个输入对所有输出的导数</td>\n<td>一个输出对所有输入的导数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合场景</td>\n<td>输入少、输出多</td>\n<td>输入多、输出少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度学习适配度</td>\n<td>差（参数即输入，极多）</td>\n<td>极佳（损失即输出，唯一）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>额外内存</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（需缓存前向激活）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>深度学习的典型形态是「上亿个参数输入、一个标量损失输出」，正好是反向模式的最佳场景：一次反向遍历就拿到全部参数的梯度。代价是必须缓存前向过程的所有中间激活，这构成训练显存的大头，也是<a href=\"../scaling/training-recipes\">梯度检查点</a>技术（用重算换显存）的针对对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动微分-让任意程序可求导\">自动微分：让任意程序可求导</h2><p>反向传播是算法，自动微分是把它通用化的系统。它的关键洞察是：任何复杂函数都由一组基本运算（加、乘、矩阵乘、exp、log 等）复合而成，只要为每个基本运算预先实现其局部导数，就能通过链式法则自动组合出任意复合函数的精确导数。这与符号微分（会表达式爆炸）和数值微分（有截断误差、慢）都不同——自动微分给出的是机器精度的精确梯度，且代价可控。</p>\n<p>现代框架主要分两种风格。一种是动态图（PyTorch 默认的 eager 模式）：边执行边记录运算到一条「磁带」上，反向时回放磁带，灵活、易调试。另一种是静态图或追踪编译（JAX 的 <code>jit</code>、PyTorch 2.x 的 <code>torch.compile</code>）：先把计算图捕获下来再整体编译优化，牺牲一点灵活换取更高的执行效率。两者在数学上等价，区别在于图何时被构建。</p>\n<p>下表对比三种「求导方式」，可以看清自动微分的位置：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>梯度来源</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数值微分</td>\n<td>有限差分近似</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>每维一次前向，随参数量爆</td>\n<td>梯度检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>符号微分</td>\n<td>直接操作表达式</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>表达式膨胀，可能指数爆炸</td>\n<td>小规模符号推导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动微分</td>\n<td>链式法则 + 局部导数</td>\n<td>机器精度</td>\n<td>与一次前向同阶</td>\n<td>深度网络训练</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三类方式里只有自动微分同时满足「精确」与「代价可控」，这正是它成为深度学习共同内核的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数值稳定与梯度的健康\">数值稳定与梯度的健康</h2><p>精确求导只是第一步，梯度在深层网络里能否「健康地」传下去是另一回事。反向传播每经过一层都会乘上该层的局部导数，几十层连乘后，梯度很容易指数级缩小（梯度消失）或放大（梯度爆炸）。这正是<a href=\"../stabilization/init-residual\">初始化与残差</a>要从源头解决的问题，也是<a href=\"../stabilization/normalization\">归一化方法</a>平滑梯度流的动机。</p>\n<p>工程上还有若干保健手段。梯度裁剪在反向传播后把梯度范数限制在阈值内，防止偶发的<a href=\"../scaling/training-recipes\">loss spike</a> 把参数冲垮；数值稳定的实现细节（如 log-sum-exp 技巧、softmax 减去最大值）避免 exp 溢出。这些细节单看微不足道，缺一个就可能让一次昂贵的训练在某一步突然变成 NaN。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>梯度由反向传播算出：它把链式法则组织在计算图上，一次反向遍历即得全部参数梯度，代价与一次前向同阶。</li>\n<li>前向计算先缓存中间激活，反向再逐节点把上游梯度乘以局部导数回传，这个两遍结构决定了训练显存的构成。</li>\n<li>深度学习用反向模式自动微分，因为「多输入参数、单输出损失」正是它的最佳场景，代价是缓存激活的内存开销。</li>\n<li>自动微分为每个基本运算预置局部导数，自动组合出机器精度的精确梯度；动态图重灵活、静态图/编译重效率。</li>\n<li>精确求导之外还需保证梯度数值健康：连乘导致的消失/爆炸由初始化、残差、归一化与梯度裁剪共同治理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"反向传播与自动微分","id":"反向传播与自动微分"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：计算图与链式法则","id":"核心概念-计算图与链式法则"},{"level":2,"text":"前向模式与反向模式","id":"前向模式与反向模式"},{"level":2,"text":"自动微分：让任意程序可求导","id":"自动微分-让任意程序可求导"},{"level":2,"text":"数值稳定与梯度的健康","id":"数值稳定与梯度的健康"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"梯度下降与变体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/dl-training-optimization/foundations/gradient-descent-variants"},"next":{"title":"SGD 与动量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/dl-training-optimization/optimizers/sgd-momentum"}}